<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hi,</span></font><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">How are you!<br></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p data-start="331" data-end="426">Good news — your quote <strong data-start="354" data-end="371">{!Quote.Name}</strong> has been successfully <strong data-start="394" data-end="420">submitted for approval</strong>! 🎉</p>
<p data-start="428" data-end="598">Our approval team has been alerted and is now reviewing it (coffee in hand ☕, of course). You’ll receive an update as soon as it’s approved or if any tweaks are needed.</p>
<p data-start="600" data-end="703">In the meantime, feel free to celebrate this small victory — every great deal starts with a click! 💪</p>
<p data-start="705" data-end="762"><br></p><div><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">Quote Name :&nbsp;</font><font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Quote.Name}</font></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Account Name :&nbsp;{!Quote.Bill_To_Account__c}</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Total Price :&nbsp;{!Quote.Total_Price_Summary__c}</span></div><p data-start="705" data-end="762"><span style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 204, 153);"></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 204, 153);"></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 204, 153);"></span></p><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Total Deal Quantity :&nbsp;{!Quote.Total_Deal_Quantity__c}</span></div><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><p data-start="705" data-end="762">Thank you for keeping the sales engines running strong.</p><p data-start="705" data-end="762"><br></p>
<p data-start="764" data-end="873">Warm regards,<br data-start="777" data-end="780">
<strong data-start="780" data-end="809">The Sales Operations Team</strong><br data-start="809" data-end="812">
“Turning quotes into closed deals, one approval at a time.”</p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><img src="https://solmillenium2--partial.sandbox.file.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015be000002tyAT&amp;oid=00Dbe000000ANL7" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></div></div>]]></td>
